---

**Do scrolls get consumed?** No. Casting from the bar never eats the scroll.

**Where did Iron’s spell bar go?** Actionbar hides it. You would otherwise have two HUDs fighting for the same strip of screen.

**Can I still use Iron’s wheel?** Not as your main cast if Codex is in the pack. Without Codex, Actionbar is just a nicer bar. With Codex, the bar is the only legal cast.

**Does Leylines work?** Yes. Leyline spells are Iron’s school spells. Put their scrolls on the bar, or unlock them through Codex.

**A block-target spell keeps saying “Target a block.”** Look at the block. Apprentice’s Codex spells like Rift Hole need a real client target. That was fixed in Actionbar 1.1.5. Update if you are on an older jar.

**Can another mod open the equip screen?** Yes. Addons can hook `SpellActionbarMenuOpeners`. Codex already does this so one key opens both the Codex and the bar.
